        "description": "Sporting a new title, the story began in AMC's Interview with the Vampire continues in The Vampire Lestat, and a rocking new clip from the next chapter in Anne Rice's beloved Vampire Chronicles debuted at IGN Live today. \nThe clip shows Lestat (Sam Reid) in his new guise as a genuine rock star, as his voice over provides an overview of his band's status, backstory, and lineup, as the ever-confident vampire explains \"Naturally, I named the band after myself,\" along with the early goal \"to induce what Gen Snooze called FOMO.\"",
