        "description": "He-Man and his fellow Masters of the Universe are now in movie theaters, and at IGN Live today, we had the exclusive debut of a video in which the stars of that film react to the just-released Masters of the Universe: Legends Unite cooperative card game. Nicholas Galitzine (\"Adam / He-Man\"), Camila Mendes (\"Teela\") and Idris Elba (\"Man-at-Arms\") got their own first look at the game and how their respective characters appear in it. This in turn inspires the trio to show off what their own signature pose would be if they themselves were in the game. Plus, they discuss which of the cast are secret -- or not so secret -- gamers.",
